{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"54b172828710b36d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Oracy.** Your words hold a power that can change the world around you. You cast magic through speaking, rarely consciously. ==Gain \"Intent\" as a part of your type of magic. The GM may ask you to roll **Spellcraft** as if for a spell, even if you did not intentionally cast one. Roll a **Spellcraft** or **Will** check prior to speaking a spell. Discuss with your GM what may trigger it, how often you would like this to come up, etc.==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-60,
			"width":500,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"86c1ec1b79563051",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Selective Voice.** You have gained a semblance of control over your speech. ==When asked to roll **Spellcraft** for a spell you did not consciously cast, you may roll a **Will save** to prevent it==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-440,
			"width":500,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"4250116b51c7c10a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Untrained Voice.** You have *mostly* mastered utilizing your magical voice. ==You no longer need to roll prior to casting a spell==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-240,
			"width":500,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"2773e924681216ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Resolute Voice.** You have truly mastered the magic of your voice. ==Gain +2 dice when casting using Oracy==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-600,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4105dbdb442e7687",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Explosive Words.** When you are overcome with emotion and cast using Oracy, your dice **[[Explode]]**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":360,
			"y":-410,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b5df8e61bad78d46",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Deafening Words.** When you raise your voice, it can be heard for miles",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-760,
			"y":-410,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"78ac8a6100cf4e72",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Whispered Words.** When you whisper, most methods of detecting magic can not detect you casting magic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-510,
			"y":-760,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"aaf83c351438d49e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Impactful Words.** When a creature hears your words, add 1 die",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":110,
			"y":-760,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		}
	],
